atom     containers/array-new-is-bracket
source   generated
gen      gen/containers.raku
law      Array.new({X})  ===  [{X}]
why      Array.new and the bracket literal are the same construction
ladder   14 spellings

- id     0001
  from   law:array-new-is-bracket
  cell   1
  code   do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); Array.new(1) }
  same-as do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); [1] }

